      "left": "Previous item within the current menu.",
      "plus": "Increase / toggle the blinking field; or enter a '+ to view/change' / '+ to enter' / '+ to start' gate.",
      "minus": "Decrease / toggle the blinking field.",
      "unlock": "Hold left+right together on Configuration Menu-Locked \u2192 Menu-Unlocked (auto-relocks after ~2 min idle)."
